about us!

14:30.208 --> 14:32.540
Well, maybe that's the problem.
Maybe they should be!

14:32.541 --> 14:34.790
Why? Oh... You know what?
We're not fucking canceling.

14:34.791 --> 14:36.999
Do you know why?
We don't have friends!

14:37.000 --> 14:38.415
You mean I'll be friends
with them?

14:38.416 --> 14:39.999
- Are you kidding me?
- Why not? Maybe.

14:40.000 --> 14:41.999
It's not my fault
we don't have friends.

14:42.000 --> 14:44.207
I would love to have friends.
People like me.

14:44.208 --> 14:45.999
Why do you think
we don't have friends?

14:46.000 --> 14:48.166
I'll tell you why:
'Cause we're fucking miserab...!

14:51.916 --> 14:53.333
Hi.

14:54.250 --> 14:55.915
Hi. Come in.

14:55.916 --> 14:57.332
Nice to see you, Angela.

14:57.333 --> 15:00.458
Yes, I'm...
We are so happy you're here.

15:02.625 --> 15:03.708
Hi.

15:04.333 --> 15:05.707
Ah, two.

15:05.708 --> 15:07.832
- Nice to meet you.
- Angela. Me too.

15:07.833 --> 15:10.374
Yes. Joe, you...

15:10.375 --> 15:12.458
You remember Piña and Hawk?

15:15.875 --> 15:18.582
This... It's still a good time?

15:18.583 --> 15:20.749
Yes. Yeah.

15:20.750 --> 15:22.415
Are you sure
we're not interrupting?

15:22.416 --> 15:23.624
No, it's great.

15:23.625 --> 15:25.165
- If it's good for you...
- Yeah.

15:25.166 --> 15:26.915
...it's great for us.
Yeah, we love... Yeah.

15:26.916 --> 15:30.999
It just... It took you a while
to come to the door,

15:31.000 --> 15:33.749
and it sounded
like you were arguing.

15:33.750 --> 15:35.540
- No filter.
- No, I just wanna be honest.

15:35.541 --> 15:38.165
We were... We were at the door
before we rang,

15:38.166 --> 15:40.249
and we could hear
you were fighting.

15:40.250 --> 15:43.040
Oh, we were talk...
We were, um...

15:43.041 --> 15:44.749
- We were fighting.
- We were fighting, yeah.

15:44.750 --> 15:46.540
Bit of a contentious
environment in here,

15:46.541 --> 15:48.665
so I understand
if that's repellent to you.

15:48.666 --> 15:50.207
No hard feelings,
you know what I mean?

15:50.208 --> 15:52.165
Completely understand.
You know?

15:52.166 --> 15:54.583
We love
a contentious environment.

15:57.625 --> 15:59.332
- We love it.
- OK.

15:59.333 --> 16:01.499
Well, really, really, it's fine.

16:01.500 --> 16:03.833
You hit the jackpot, then,
my friend.

16:04.666 --> 16:06.374
You're in for a treat.

16:06.375 --> 16:07.790
- OK?
- Yeah, great.

16:07.791 --> 16:09.290
Do we have
to take our shoes off?

16:09.291 --> 16:11.499
Oh God, no.
No, no! No! No!

16:11.500 --> 16:13.415
- Yeah. OK. Great.
- Hey... Hey, Joe.

16:13.416 --> 16:15.082
- May I look at this place?
- Yeah, thank you.

16:15.083 --> 16:17.375
Joe! Be honest,
do you want us to take 'em off?

16:19.208 --> 16:21.957
I don't give a fuck if you
take your shoes off, personally.

16:21.958 --> 16:23.833
God...

16:28.958 --> 16:31.207
- Hawk, is it?
- Hawk, yeah. Yeah.

16:31.208 --> 16:33.125
- Like the bird?
- Yep, like the bird.

16:33.916 --> 16:35.457
Cool.

16:35.458 --> 16:37.375
This guy.

16:38.541 --> 16:40.707
We've been dying
to see your apartment.

16:40.708 --> 16:44.124
Oh! Oh, God. I'm so sorry.
We wanted to invite you.

16:44.125 --> 16:45.624
It wasn't quite ready before.

16:45.625 --> 16:47.374
Still isn't quite ready
if you ask me.

16:47.375 --> 16:49.290
Yeah, 'cause you mentioned it
in the elevator,

16:49.291 --> 16:50.790
but then you never called.

16:50.791 --> 16:52.499
- Yes.
- We, uh...

16:52.500 --> 16:54.582
What? No... I mean, we wondered
if we did something wrong.

16:54.583 --> 16:55.832
- No, God, no.
- Well...

16:55.833 --> 16:57.874
No, no, no, no, no.
No, no, no.

16:57.875 --> 16:59.457
No, I'm sorry about that. No.

16:59.458 --> 17:01.915
What do you...
What do you think?

17:01.916 --> 17:03.707
- It's huge.
- So much bigger now.

17:03.708 --> 17:06.375
- It has such a nice flow.
- You guys have money?

17:16.333 --> 17:17.957
Just saying...

17:17.958 --> 17:20.957
You really... You really got
some beautiful pieces.

17:20.958 --> 17:22.749
- It's all Angela.
- Well, I know what I like,

17:22.750 --> 17:24.749
- but it's not all expensive.
- Some of it is very expensive.

17:24.750 --> 17:27.124
- Some of it. Most of it's not.
- Some of it is, though.

17:27.125 --> 17:28.790
- Not everything.
- But some of it.

17:28.791 --> 17:30.374
I guess what I meant to say is,

17:30.375 --> 17:32.665
you can tell that it's been done
with a lot of care,

17:32.666 --> 17:34.625
and you have a really great eye.

17:35.791 --> 17:38.207
That's true.
I... I can feel it.

17:38.208 --> 17:40.333
I feel you put so much love.

17:41.375 --> 17:43.874
I... I did that.
Thank you, yeah.

17:43.875 --> 17:45.749
I...

17:45.750 --> 17:48.540
I love it. I do love it.
I really care. I do.

17:48.541 --> 17:51.207
- Thank you for saying that.
- I can see it.

17:51.208 --> 17:52.791
I care.
I do care a lot. I...

17:54.875 --> 17:57.707
I'm so sorry.
I'm getting emotional.

17:57.708 --> 18:00.707
I don't know why,
but I thank you.

18:00.708 --> 18:02.374
Thank you for saying that.

18:02.375 --> 18:04.041
- Yeah, it has...
- ...great energy.

18:05.916 --> 18:08.957
- Oh! I...
- Wow! Look at that!

18:08.958 --> 18:11.207
Energy is what I was going for.
That's what I wanted.

18:11.208 --> 18:13.707
Energy's great. We talked a lot
about how to capture energy,

18:13.708 --> 18:15.582
as though that was a real thing
we could do.

18:15.583 --> 18:18.374
- Well, energy is everything.
- Really?

18:18.375 --> 18:22.290
Kinetic, chemical, potential,
nuclear, sexual.

18:22.291 --> 18:25.332
You cannot really create it
or destroy it,

18:25.333 --> 18:28.249
but you can find ways
to shape it.

18:28.250 --> 18:30.999
- Mm.
- Beautiful.

18:31.000 --> 18:32.624
You shaped it
really beautifully here.

18:32.625 --> 18:34.500
- I love the shape.
- Thank you.

18:35.708 --> 18:37.374
Too existential for you, Joe?

18:37.375 --> 18:39.540
No. Hey...
Not existential enough for me.

18:39.541 --> 18:42.291
Let's get deep.
What is life?

18:46.125 --> 18:49.165
Oh, that is my Spanish flan.

18:49.166 --> 18:52.624
No! Oh, my God! Flan.
Oh, how elegant.

18:52.625 --> 18:54.207
Fair warning.

18:54.208 --> 18:56.707
Once you try Piña's flan,
there's no going back.

18:56.708 --> 18:58.499
You'll be at our door
late at night,

18:58.500 --> 19:00.124
like a junkie under the bridge,

19:00.125 --> 19:03.708
saying, "We need a score",
like, uh... heroin.

19:05.375 --> 19:07.499
Wow!

19:07.500 --> 19:08.833
Hmm.

19:10.333 --> 19:11.540
You might wanna
put it in the fridge.

19:11.541 --> 19:13.165
Yes. Yeah. Come...

19:13.166 --> 19:14.415
Yeah, you want it refrigerated.

19:14.416 --> 19:16.249
- Is it "flawn" or "flan"?
- Flan.

19:16.250 --> 19:17.540
- Flan?
- Flan.

19:17.541 --> 19:19.333
- Thought it was "flawn".
- Yes.

19:25.458 --> 19:27.291
Oh!

19:29.625 --> 19:31.958
- Remember to...
- Yes! Right!

19:35.625 --> 19:37.624
I'm so sorry. I haven't...

19:37.625 --> 19:40.832
I literally haven't offered you
anything to drink. I'm so...

19:40.833 --> 19:46.707
We have
some beautiful sparkling...

19:46.708 --> 19:48.749
- Hmm!
- ...um, that...

19:48.750 --> 19:50.249
Or maybe you'd prefer...

19:50.250 --> 19:51.874
- Wine.
- Wine's better.

19:51.875 --> 19:54.207
- Wine. Wine.
- Yeah.

19:54.208 --> 19:56.499
Wine.
Do we have wine?

19:56.500 --> 19:58.540
- We do have wine.
- We do have wine?

19:58.541 --> 20:00.165
- Oh, we do. We have wine.
- Oh, wine.

20:00.166 --> 20:02.665
We have...
We have the anniversary wine.

20:02.666 --> 20:04.249
- Our anniversary wine?
- Yes.

20:04.250 --> 20:06.124
The wine my uncle gave us
for our anniversary

20:06.125 --> 20:07.749
that we've been saving
for a special occasion?

20:07.750 --> 20:09.290
- Château Haut-Brion?
- Yes.

20:09.291 --> 20:10.790
- 1980?
- Yes.

20:10.791 --> 20:12.582
Get the wine!

20:12.583 --> 20:13.957
- We have.
- We do have wine.

20:13.958 --> 20:16.082
We've been waiting
for the perfect moment.

20:16.083 --> 20:18.249
- Are you sure this is it?
- Yes! Yeah! Yeah, yeah. Yep.

20:18.250 --> 20:21.165
Yeah. Totally.

20:21.166 --> 20:23.874
That's great. Finally!

20:23.875 --> 20:25.874
- Yep. Mm-hmm.
- There it is. 1982.

20:25.875 --> 20:27.374
- Yeah.
- Château Haut-Brion.

20:27.375 --> 20:28.874
Perfect. Great.

20:28.875 --> 20:30.082
You wanna save that
for another time?

20:30.083 --> 20:31.749
Oh my God, no! What time?

20:31.750 --> 20:33.624
- This is it!
- No. Are you kidding me? Yeah.

20:33.625 --> 20:35.833
No time like the present, huh?

20:36.708 --> 20:38.874
Do you wanna open it?

20:38.875 --> 20:43.082
- Of course. Yeah. Um... yep.
- That's not where it is.

20:43.083 --> 20:44.707
It's usually in there.
It should be in there.

20:44.708 --> 20:47.124
- No, it's never been in there.
- Definitely, I...

20:47.125 --> 20:49.040
- It should be in here.
- No, it's never been in there.

20:49.041 --> 20:51.749
- Literally never been in there!
- Never been in there?

20:51.750 --> 20:53.832
It's not there. No, 'cause I
never would've put it in there.

20:53.833 --> 20:55.582
- That's not where it goes.
- Often is in there.

20:55.583 --> 20:57.457
It's literally
never been there.

20:57.458 --> 20:59.500
- Do you want me to do it?
- Got it!

21:01.083 --> 21:02.791
Sorry. We don't, um...

21:03.875 --> 21:06.582
...have people over very often.

21:06.583 --> 21:08.040
- Do you want me to do it?
- I got it.

21:08.041 --> 21:09.208
OK.

21:15.375 --> 21:17.249
- Boom! My God...
- Bravo!

21:17.250 --> 21:18.707
Wow!

21:18.708 --> 21:20.332
- Little bit of cork in there.
- Yeah...

21:20.333 --> 21:21.624
I had confidence, Joe.

21:21.625 --> 21:23.207
Thank you.
I knew I'd get there.

21:23.208 --> 21:24.957
Ah...

21:24.958 --> 21:28.707
- Mm... Yeah.
- Thank you so much.

21:28.708 --> 21:30.207
- Yes. Great.
- Sláinte.

21:30.208 --> 21:32.582
- Salud.
- Joe, thank your uncle.

21:32.583 --> 21:34.832
He's, uh... He's dead, so...

21:34.833 --> 21:38.249
Maybe next time.
Pretty weird guy.

21:38.250 --> 21:40.249
- Oh, how is your daughter?
- Maggie?

21:40.250 --> 21:41.582
She's so cool.

21:41.583 --> 21:43.165
She is cool.
Yeah. She's great.

21:43.166 --> 21:45.124
- I love her style.
- I know, right?

21:45.125 --> 21:46.665
- She's awesome.
- Yeah, she's...

21:46.666 --> 21:49.457
She's amazing.
I'm really gonna miss her.

21:49.458 --> 21:50.875
Where's she going?

21:52.416 --> 21:54.165
To college.

21:54.166 --> 21:57.165
In six years?
She's... She's twelve years old!

21:57.166 --> 22:00.165
Yeah, I know. But it's just...
I'm gonna miss her,

22:00.166 --> 22:02.957
and I'm just gonna be alone.

22:02.958 --> 22:05.124
What about me?
Where have I gone?

22:05.125 --> 22:06.832
I'm just saying it's gonna be...

22:06.833 --> 22:08.915
- It's gonna be different.
- Do you know something I don't?

22:08.916 --> 22:11.665
No, I do not. I'm just saying,
it... won't be the same.

22:11.666 --> 22:14.082
It's not gonna be the same.
So... I'm sorry.

22:14.083 --> 22:16.790
I'm just, I feel like
I'm becoming emotional again.

22:16.791 --> 22:18.582
Sorry for what?

22:18.583 --> 22:20.915
I mean, we would be crazy
if we didn't cry.

22:20.916 --> 22:22.499
- Yeah.
- You know, it's the best way

22:22.500 --> 22:25.332
to release stress hormones, cortisol.

22:25.333 --> 22:27.582
Oh, I have a lot of that, then.
That's what I do.

22:27.583 --> 22:29.165
- She does.
- It's just...

22:29.166 --> 22:30.957
There's nothing in the world
better than being a mom,

22:30.958 --> 22:32.540
you know?

22:32.541 --> 22:35.332
For... For some.

22:35.333 --> 22:40.624
But not everyone, because
that... that isn't your path.

22:40.625 --> 22:43.332
- You... You don't...
- I mean, we talk about it.

22:43.333 --> 22:44.915
- We think about it.
- Right.

22:44.916 --> 22:47.207
- Hasn't been a priority.
- Yeah.

22:47.208 --> 22:48.749
- No, no. Yeah, maybe.
- Yeah.

22:48.750 --> 22:50.374
- Maybe.
- That's great.

22:50.375 --> 22:52.125
You should probably decide
sooner than later.

22:53.333 --> 22:54.500
What?

22:56.333 --> 22:58.958
Whether or not
you're gonna have children.

23:00.333 --> 23:01.541
Why?

23:03.000 --> 23:06.625
You know, just due to age.

23:09.166 --> 23:10.582
Whose age?

23:10.583 --> 23:12.290
You know? I mean...

23:12.291 --> 23:14.499
Picasso had a baby
when he was ninety, so...

23:14.500 --> 23:18.082
It's more... It's probably
more the science stuff.

23:18.083 --> 23:19.874
Mm... Science.

23:19.875 --> 23:23.749
Traditionally, the woman is...
I didn't want to talk about it.

23:23.750 --> 23:25.707
Actually, I have something...

23:25.708 --> 23:27.457
You know, time, she marches.

23:27.458 --> 23:29.540
Don't know if you saw it before,
but this is just something,

23:29.541 --> 23:32.999
a gesture to remind you of home.

23:33.000 --> 23:35.790
Uh, it's just a little,
um... jamón.

23:35.791 --> 23:37.915
Oh, that is so sweet,
and I love how you say it.

23:37.916 --> 23:39.665
- Can you say it again?
- Jamón.

23:39.666 --> 23:41.999
Oh, my God.
It's so sweet, I will eat you!

23:42.000 --> 23:44.583
- I cannot... I don't eat meat.
- Hmm?

23:45.958 --> 23:47.040
- No?
- He does.

23:47.041 --> 23:48.916
I do. Yeah.
Full carnivore.

23:50.375 --> 23:52.707
Cheese? Do you...
We have so much cheese!

23:52.708 --> 23:55.540
No. I mean... no.
For me, no cheese.

23:55.541 --> 23:57.624
- You don't eat cheese? No...
- She's a vegan.

23:57.625 --> 23:59.499
- Inflammation.
- Right, yeah.

23:59.500 --> 24:01.874
- Oh, the crackers.
- I don't. Mm-mm.

24:01.875 --> 24:03.332
For me, also no.

24:03.333 --> 24:06.207
No gluten, no dairy, no meat,
no sugar.

24:06.208 --> 24:07.874
We got almonds.
You want almonds?

24:07.875 --> 24:09.249
Ah...

24:09.250 --> 24:12.207
- You love almonds.
- I love almonds.

24:12.208 --> 24:14.999
Really failed on the meat,
then, huh?

24:15.000 --> 24:17.374
Meat fail.
Failed on the meat. It's OK.

24:17.375 --> 24:19.290
I will eat Piña's meat.

24:19.291 --> 24:21.999
All your beautiful meat
will get eaten. I'm starving.

24:22.000 --> 24:23.582
- Mm-hmm.
- Yeah.

24:23.583 --> 24:25.207
It's totally... Hey, it's great.

24:25.208 --> 24:26.665
- Thank you.
- Yeah.

24:26.666 --> 24:28.207
Is there a bathroom I can use
before I...?

24:28.208 --> 24:29.790
It's this... that.

24:29.791 --> 24:32.665
- Yeah. Thank you. It's lovely.
- Great. I just...

24:32.666 --> 24:34.832
Piña, what do you want to eat?

24:34.833 --> 24:36.665
Whatever you want, I can get it.
I can order it.

24:36.666 --> 24:37.999
I can get it here so fast.

24:38.000 --> 24:39.665
Five minutes.
They come on a bike.

24:39.666 --> 24:41.374
Anything, any cuisine you like.

24:41.375 --> 24:42.957
- What do you like?
- She's fine.

24:42.958 --> 24:44.999
- I don't want anything.
- Yeah, she's good.

24:45.000 --> 24:46.415
But I don't understand

24:46.416 --> 24:49.624
how you put all of this together
so quickly.

24:49.625 --> 24:51.582
I mean, we only planned
this morning.

24:51.583 --> 24:54.415
- This is like magic.
- This morning? Really?

24:54.416 --> 24:57.999
Was it? Or... I think yes...
yesterday morning.

24:58.000 --> 24:59.457
- Just this morning?
- This morning.

24:59.458 --> 25:01.124
- Not yesterday.
- Last... Last morning.

25:01.125 --> 25:02.915
- This morning?
- Last morning.

25:02.916 --> 25:05.540
That's not an expression.
This morning. Happened today.

25:05.541 --> 25:07.749
Just because the days, they...
You know how they...

25:07.750 --> 25:09.332
They kind of
blur into one.

25:09.333 --> 25:11.249
- This morning.
- Yes.

25:11.250 --> 25:13.165
Are you cold?

25:13.166 --> 25:15.332
What are you doing?
What's happening right now?

25:15.333 --> 25:17.957
- What you doing right now?
- Am I OK?

25:17.958 --> 25:19.499
I don't know.
Are you choking?

25:19.500 --> 25:22.624
I just feel a little...
Am I OK?

25:22.625 --> 25:23.957
Are you choking
right now?

25:23.958 --> 25:26.040
No, I...

25:26.041 --> 25:29.166
- I get a little...
- This happens a lot?

25:39.958 --> 25:42.290
It could be the beginning
of perimenopause.

25:42.291 --> 25:43.874
- What?
- Perimenopause?

25:43.875 --> 25:46.207
And it can be such
a challenging, horrible time...

25:46.208 --> 25:47.457
Holy shit.

25:47.458 --> 25:49.082
...and last
more than ten years.

25:49.083 --> 25:50.999
- Oh, God.
- Oh, my God. Great!

25:51.000 --> 25:52.415
Makes me so angry,

25:52.416 --> 25:54.790
how so many people still today

25:54.791 --> 25:57.582
talk about hot flashes
as the only problem.

25:57.583 --> 25:59.665
- I know.
- This is a serious,

25:59.666 --> 26:03.457
huge neuroendocrine change
that affects everything -

26:03.458 --> 26:07.165
memory, cardiovascular health,
metabolism -

26:07.166 --> 26:09.624
and we are expected
just to deal with it.

26:09.625 --> 26:13.790
Just deal with depression,
anxiety, brain fog, insomnia.

26:13.791 --> 26:16.207
Mood swings.
Is that one of 'em?

26:16.208 --> 26:18.207
Yeah. Yeah.
Resentment towards your spouse.

26:18.208 --> 26:21.040
Overspending
on home goods and cheeses.

26:21.041 --> 26:23.166
Abundance of charcuterie.

26:24.666 --> 26:26.707
I knew you were gonna make
a joke about it.

26:26.708 --> 26:28.707
I am. I'm making a joke.
I thought...

26:28.708 --> 26:31.332
Let me explain it to you
in a different way.

26:31.333 --> 26:33.000
OK.

26:34.458 --> 26:40.499
What if your testicles
shriveled up and died,

26:40.500 --> 26:44.790
and your empty ball sack
flopped around in the breeze

26:44.791 --> 26:49.082
for the next thirty years or so?

26:49.083 --> 26:51.166
How would you like that?

26:52.541 --> 26:54.207
I wouldn't like that.

26:54.208 --> 26:56.707
- No. You wouldn't.
- No.

26:56.708 --> 26:59.874
- So, don't joke about it.
- OK. Copy that. I won't.

26:59.875 --> 27:02.040
I get it. I'm sorry.

27:02.041 --> 27:04.165
Are you a doctor
or something like that?

27:04.166 --> 27:06.957
- I'm a psychotherapist.
- Ah.

27:06.958 --> 27:08.874
- And a sexologist.
- Oh.

27:08.875 --> 27:11.582
- "Sexologist"?
- And I also care about women.

27:11.583 --> 27:13.540
I, uh... care about women.

27:13.541 --> 27:17.832
