- Sure?

27:38.000 --> 27:39.957
Yes, I'm positive. Yeah.

27:39.958 --> 27:41.374
They might.

27:41.375 --> 27:42.790
- Don't think so.
- No?

27:42.791 --> 27:44.499
Remember The Onslaught?

27:44.500 --> 27:46.499
- Yeah, The Onslaught.
- They had a song, uh...

27:46.500 --> 27:48.124
"One Girl".
