- No.

28:13.083 --> 28:14.999
But, I mean...
You know, can we...

28:15.000 --> 28:17.499
- Can you find it on Spotify?
- No.

28:17.500 --> 28:19.957
Do you ever play live?
We could come see you.

28:19.958 --> 28:21.874
Yeah, you kind of
missed that window

28:21.875 --> 28:24.290
