with carpets.

29:04.583 --> 29:06.124
Oh! So am I.

29:06.125 --> 29:09.082
- I love rugs. Joe not so much.
- Not so much.

29:09.083 --> 29:11.666
More into credenza,
sconces, things like that.

29:14.500 --> 29:16.457
Holy shit,
I think it's a Heriz.

29:16.458 --> 29:17.915
No!

29:17.916 --> 29:19.665
- And it's...
- Where did you get this?

29:19.666 --> 29:22.457
- I got it at a flea market.
- A flea market? No, you didn't.

29:22.458 --> 29:23.624
- I did.
- No, you didn't.

29:23.625 --> 29:25.207
I just liked the colors.

29:25.208 --> 29:28.165
You did? Well, you found
a Van Gogh in a garage sale.

29:28.166 --> 29:29.790
- I did?
- Wow, look at that!

29:29.791 --> 29:32.457
- But it's a rug, so...
- No, it's not.

29:32.458 --> 29:34.582
- It's a Heriz.
- It's a Heriz.

29:34.583 --> 29:36.083
Rug.

29:36.708 --> 29:38.374
Hmm.

29:38.375 --> 29:40.790
But you didn't pay
a fortune for this?

29:40.791 --> 29:41.915
I did not.

29:41.916 --> 29:43.499
- You swear?
- It's a rug.

29:43.500 --> 29:47.957
Wow. You have a gift. I mean...
And that's, like... wow!

29:47.958 --> 29:50.540
I wanna take off my clothes
and just lie naked on it.

29:50.541 --> 29:51.957
- Do it.
- Can you imagine

29:51.958 --> 29:54.082
