- Wow!

30:03.166 --> 30:04.999
Really good energy.
Yeah.

30:05.000 --> 30:07.290
He did our entire apartment.

30:07.291 --> 30:09.499
It's so beautiful.
You have to come over.

30:09.500 --> 30:11.332
